            "parallelValue": [],
            "groupedValue": [],
            "value": "Flager, Forest and Adya, Akshay and Haymaker, John. (2009). TR186: AEC Multidisciplinary Design Optimization: Impact of High Performance Computing. Stanford Digital Repository. Available at: http://purl.stanford.edu/rb200qx5476",
